    "ParentObjectID": "water_sawmill_grinding_mill_placed",
    "LocalizationKey": "Water_Sawmill_GrindingMillPlaced_CardDescription",
    "DefaultText": "A large water-powered grinding mill for batch processing millable materials."
  },
  "CardHelpSection": {
    "ParentObjectID": "water_sawmill_grinding_mill_placed",
    "LocalizationKey": "Water_Sawmill_GrindingMillPlaced_CardHelpSection",
    "DefaultText": "<b>Requirements:</b> Requires a local mill race for water power.\n\n<b>Operation:</b> Load millable items, then press Grind All to process the full batch on demand, like a larger rotary quern.\n\n<b>Time:</b> Grind All takes 30 minutes.\n\n<b>Overshot Wheel:</b> Drag an Overshot Wheel onto the mill to fit it (30 minutes): Grind All then takes 15 minutes. Pack Up (Overshot) packs the mill and gives the wheel back."
  },
